      "text": "run.py — two protocols\n\n--protocol stratified   random split (default)\n--protocol external     hold out an ENTIRE cohort\n\nuse external for BraTS 2021 → BraTS-Africa:\n~29 test cases cannot resolve a 0.03 AURC effect",
