      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "evaluate.py — metrics\n\ncalibration    ECE · adaptive ECE · Brier · NLL\ngate quality   risk–coverage · AURC · E-AURC\noperational    risk @ 80% coverage,\n               coverage @ 5% / 10% risk\nsignificance   paired bootstrap CI on ΔAURC\n\nE-AURC because raw AURC is bounded below by\nthe error rate — subtracting the optimal curve\nisolates the confidence RANKING",
      "originalText": "evaluate.py — metrics\n\ncalibration    ECE · adaptive ECE · Brier · NLL\ngate quality   risk–coverage · AURC · E-AURC\noperational    risk @ 80% coverage,\n               coverage @ 5% / 10% risk\nsignificance   paired bootstrap CI on ΔAURC\n\nE-AURC because raw AURC is bounded below by\nthe error rate — subtracting the optimal curve\nisolates the confidence RANKING",
