      "type": "text",
      "x": 1400.0,
      "y": 1357.5,
      "width": 420.0,
      "height": 385.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "docs/findings.md — results so far\n\nTHE CLAIM (falsifiable):\nB6 beats B4 on AURC in the low-quality cohort,\npaired-bootstrap CI excluding zero.\nIf the CI crosses zero, routing did not help —\nand that is the result we report.\n\nOBSERVED:\n· routing came out WORSE under shift\n  (AURC +0.05 … +0.06)\n· cause 1 — the router never saw the target domain\n  → --calib-target-fraction 0.15\n  gate coverage 56% → 89%   (FIXED)\n· cause 2 — the router is overparameterised:\n  120 params on ~40 calibration cases.\n  ranking is fine (E-AURC 0.164 vs 0.168),\n  accuracy is not (0.437 vs 0.513)\n  → --router-shared cuts it to 24   (OPEN)\n\nrun the low-capacity router before reporting\na negative result",
      "originalText": "docs/findings.md — results so far\n\nTHE CLAIM (falsifiable):\nB6 beats B4 on AURC in the low-quality cohort,\npaired-bootstrap CI excluding zero.\nIf the CI crosses zero, routing did not help —\nand that is the result we report.\n\nOBSERVED:\n· routing came out WORSE under shift\n  (AURC +0.05 … +0.06)\n· cause 1 — the router never saw the target domain\n  → --calib-target-fraction 0.15\n  gate coverage 56% → 89%   (FIXED)\n· cause 2 — the router is overparameterised:\n  120 params on ~40 calibration cases.\n  ranking is fine (E-AURC 0.164 vs 0.168),\n  accuracy is not (0.437 vs 0.513)\n  → --router-shared cuts it to 24   (OPEN)\n\nrun the low-capacity router before reporting\na negative result",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r129",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "roundness": null
